u003C/span>❦ \u003Cspan class=\"error\" title=\"hi tag with rend=stacked is not supported!\">𐆌\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"μνημίον\">\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">μ͡ν͡η͡μ\u003C/span>(ίον)\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθά[δε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"κῖτε\">[κῖτε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Γεώργιος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Γεώργιος\">Γεώργιος\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"παῖς\">παῖ[ς]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀναπαυ\n                    σάμενος\">[ἀναπαυ?-]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[σ]ά̣μ(ενος)\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"μ𐆌ηνῶν\">μ(ηνῶν)\u003C/span> θ´ \u003Cspan data-text=\"μηνὶ\">μ(ηνὶ)\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"Μαΐῳ\">Μαΐῳ\u003C/span> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>❦\u003Cspan class=\"error\" title=\"hi tag with rend=stacked is not supported!\">𐆌\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"μνημίον\">\u003Cspan class=\"petraeligature\" title=\"Ligature: these characters are joined\">Μ͡Ν͡Η͡Μ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κῖτε\">....]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Γεώργιος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Γεώργιος\">ΓΕΩΡΓΙΟΣ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"παῖς\">ΠΑΙ[.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀναπαυ\n                    σάμενος\">......]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[.].Μ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"μ𐆌ηνῶν\">Μ𐆌\u003C/span>Θ\u003Cspan data-text=\"μηνὶ\">Μ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Μαΐῳ\">ΜΑΙΩ\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text of Manganaro\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 3\">line.3: \u003Cspan>A small S above Μ represents the abbreviation\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Memorial. Here lies infant Georgios, passed away at 9 months in the month of May...\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>\u003Cp>The inscription is dated to the Byzantine period on the basis of the presence of abbreviation marks. The structure of the epitaph is the same as that of IMusCatania 198 (5th–6th century CE), which features the heading \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">μνημεῖον\u003C/span> and the expression \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐνθάδε κεῖται\u003C/span>, followed by the name of the deceased in the nominative (cf. Korhonen 2004, 265).\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 2001 51.1201 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u00